sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Dispatch, source safety, evidence and fenced result
  accDescr: Relay publishes a UUID, a leased worker fetches and checks the source and passes the safety gate before parsing/provider use. PostgreSQL fences the final report.
  participant R as Relay
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant W as Worker
  participant O as Object store
  participant S as Safety gate
  participant P as Converse<br/>provider
  R->>DB: 3 Read outbox
  R->>Q: 4 Publish job UUID
  Q-->>R: Confirmed
  R->>DB: Mark sent
  Q->>W: UUID delivery
  W->>DB: 5 Claim lease + document
  W->>O: 5.1 GET source
  O-->>W: Bytes
  Note over W: Verify size/SHA
  W->>S: 5.2 Safety check
  S-->>W: Clean or fail closed
  Note over W: 5.3 Parse or version cache
  W->>P: 5.4 Source + skills + UUIDs
  P-->>W: Proposed evidence
  W->>DB: 6 Validate quotes + document/lease<br/>Score and save one report
